00:36:53.170 --> 00:36:54.920
that we've been working
together to solve,

00:36:54.920 --> 00:36:57.790
and essentially it's this notion
that when you have hybrid cloud

00:36:57.790 --> 00:37:01.480
solutions, it's relatively
well-understood how

00:37:01.480 --> 00:37:03.260
to provision services
