00:37:12.910 --> 00:37:14.090
and things like that.

00:37:14.090 --> 00:37:16.420
So the idea was
how to first start

00:37:16.420 --> 00:37:18.100
by addressing
secure connectivity

00:37:18.100 --> 00:37:20.080
between private cloud
and public cloud,

00:37:20.080 --> 00:37:22.630
regardless of how many offices,
many branches, many sites

00:37:22.630 --> 00:37:23.650
